{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 2, :comments ["<b>divided</b> — for they do not have one portion." "<b>now they shall be desolate</b> — from the root of שממה, like תאשם שומרון, which is like והאדמה לא תשם, and their heart, being divided, He will demolish their altars, for they multiplied them in the manner of וערפתו הריסות [\"and you shall break down and shatter\"]."], :book :hosea, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 10, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Hosea -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/daat/olam_hatanah/mefaresh.asp?book=15&perek=1&mefaresh=ezra"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:50:46.001761555Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}